1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,233
Ma una centrale

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,321
nucleare può esplodere

3
00:00:02,321 --> 00:00:03,061
come una bomba

4
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:03,840
atomica?

5
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,120
No

6
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,294
E non perché qualcuno

7
00:00:06,294 --> 00:00:07,250
la tiene a bada

8
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,900
lo impedisce la fisica

9
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,740
In una bomba

10
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,850
l'uranio 235

11
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:13,960
è quasi puro

12
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,446
più di 90 nuclei

13
00:00:15,446 --> 00:00:16,260
su 100

14
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,920
Ogni neutrone

15
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,600
anche se velocissimo

16
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,432
trova subito

17
00:00:20,432 --> 00:00:21,710
un nucleo da spaccare

18
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,392
e in meno

19
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:23,379
di un milionesimo

20
00:00:23,379 --> 00:00:24,020
di secondo

21
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:24,612
si libera

22
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:25,800
tutta l'energia

23
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,634
Per una centrale

24
00:00:31,634 --> 00:00:32,440
nucleare

25
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,366
è completamente

26
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:34,130
diverso

27
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,098
Nella pastiglia

28
00:00:36,098 --> 00:00:37,365
di una centrale

29
00:00:37,365 --> 00:00:38,069
infatti

30
00:00:38,069 --> 00:00:39,126
l'uranio 235

31
00:00:39,126 --> 00:00:40,393
è solo da 3 a 5

32
00:00:40,393 --> 00:00:41,820
nuclei su 100

33
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,680
Tutti gli altri

34
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,140
sono uranio 238

35
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,240
e molti neutroni

36
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,180
finiscono lì

37
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,270
assorbiti

38
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:49,898
Per andare avanti

39
00:00:49,898 --> 00:00:50,547
la reazione

40
00:00:50,547 --> 00:00:51,960
ha bisogno dell'acqua

41
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:52,588
che rallenta

42
00:00:52,588 --> 00:00:53,320
i neutroni

43
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,506
E i neutroni

44
00:00:54,506 --> 00:00:55,810
più sono lenti

45
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:56,894
più probabilità

46
00:00:56,894 --> 00:00:58,121
hanno di interagire

47
00:00:58,121 --> 00:00:59,480
con l'uranio 235

48
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,240
E se il nocciolo

49
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,301
si scalda troppo

50
00:01:02,301 --> 00:01:03,417
l'acqua si dilata

51
00:01:03,417 --> 00:01:04,254
e frena meno

52
00:01:04,254 --> 00:01:05,280
i neutroni

53
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,380
la reazione

54
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,630
rallenta da sola

55
00:01:08,330 --> 00:01:09,279
Un incidente

56
00:01:09,279 --> 00:01:10,354
anche se molto

57
00:01:10,354 --> 00:01:11,618
molto improbabile

58
00:01:11,618 --> 00:01:12,930
può succedere

59
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,049
ma un'esplosione

60
00:01:14,049 --> 00:01:14,559
atomica

61
00:01:14,559 --> 00:01:15,376
è fisicamente

62
00:01:15,376 --> 00:01:16,390
impossibile

63
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:18,270
Hai qualche domanda?

64
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:19,750
Fammela nei commenti!

